  "answer": "The rate for a 2.2 kW (3.0 HP) submersible dewatering pump set under water supply works is Rs. 40,013.00 per each, as listed in Item S-5.57.1 of Chapter S (Water Supply) of the RHB BSR 2024 [S5]. This is a complete item rate for providing, installation, testing and commissioning of the pump set [S5]. Although Item S-5.57.11 lists a higher rate of Rs. 88,983.00 for the same capacity, it appears to be a typographical duplication or error, as both items describe identical specifications and S-5.57.1 is the correctly numbered sub-item under S-5.57 [S5].",
